      ":question/worked-solution": "- $D$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 2 is $-1\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 1 is $-1\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
